  "detailed_description": "The scheme &amp;quot;Assistance in Packing Materials under Post Harvest Management of Horticultural Produce&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat,  aims to support farmers by providing financial aid for packing materials used in post-harvest stages to maintain quality and reduce losses. \n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. The applicant must be a farmer.\n   1.  The applicant must be a resident of Gujarat.\n   1. The applicant should be engaged in horticultural cultivation.\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
